{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "056H", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{modules-section-support}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{algebra-section-support}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:117fa5f1b10dfa050910bd014ec217be2b06bb2d183d7fb06cba72d45cc62744", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nIn this section we collect some elementary results on supports of\nquasi-coherent modules on schemes.\nRecall that the support of a sheaf of modules has been defined in\nModules, Section <REF_0001>.\nOn the other hand, the support of a module was defined in\nAlgebra, Section <REF_0002>.\nThese match.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f92e364ecfe6eb863e8c12f614eae88b6ac93a6ed679452482873debf3c5bf2c", "unit_id": "tag:056H:prose-0001"}
